    {
      "id": "b1774467865431",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "<rgr>Run Girl Run</rgr> is an animation studio based in Toronto. We aim to bring unique concepts and ideas to life.",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1774470023567",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "Mostly working in 3D animation, we're always expanding our knowledge to better serve the stories we want to tell. Whether an idea lives better in a different medium altogether, we go for it.",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1774469938825",
      "type": "quote",
      "content": "Eventually, the goal is to make original features, built entirely in-house from the ground up.",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1774470306468",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "The studio is led by an animator and generalist with production experience at the National Film Board of Canada. That background informs how we work — with an understanding of pipelines, collaboration, and general creativeness that comes with it.",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1774473102333",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "Independently developed and released character assets — rigged, textured, and animation-ready — for a <i>AAA game title</i>, shipped publicly and used actively by players with a combined total of: ",
      "align": "left"
    },
